   "subject": "Re: Rotating tip labels in fan or circle format so they are not upside down",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">You can use ggtree(fulltree, layout=&#39;circular&#39;) + geom_tiplab2() in future release.<br><br>geom_tiplab2 is equivalent to geom_tiplab(aes(subset=(abs(angle) &lt; 90), angle=angle)) + geom_tiplab(aes(subset=(abs(angle) &gt;= 90), angle=angle+180), hjust=1)</div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
